The VELUX ACTIVE departure mode code (login, scenario signing, gateway key pairing on port 25050) follows the
protocol documented by ha-velux-active, https://github.com/Niek/ha-velux-active, Copyright (c) 2026 Niek van der
Maas, MIT License.

Home Connect appliances are reached with the homeconnect-websocket library,
https://github.com/chris-mc1/homeconnect_websocket (used as a dependency, not copied). Appliance profiles come from
the Home Connect Profile Downloader, https://github.com/bruestel/homeconnect-profile-downloader.

Samsung appliances are reached with the smartthings-local library, https://github.com/QuiteYellow/SmartThings-Local
(MIT, used as a dependency). The washer course names per course table come from the localthings project,
https://github.com/mbillow/localthings, Copyright (c) 2026 Marc Billow, MIT License.

Tuya devices are reached with the tinytuya library, https://github.com/jasonacox/tinytuya (MIT, used as a
dependency).
